{
 "about": "Which other mods' records and assets Flying_BRICKS uses when they are installed. Read by tools/generate_terminal_data.py. ammo maps a foreign AMMO record to our caliber, and the record is replaced by ours in memory. visuals name each caliber's models in Armament and Munitions; exact false means a close caliber's model from the same family. Armament, Munitions and Weapons of Fate entries were checked against those mods' plugins and archives. Caliber Complex ammo and every BIBFX entry were not, because those mods were not available to check.",
